[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21885.51, "timestamp": "06:04:45", "text": "44. 太紧了。太热了。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21886.75, "timestamp": "06:04:46", "text": "所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21895.03, "timestamp": "06:04:55", "text": "我的意思是，至少从某种意义上说，这是好事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21898.548, "timestamp": "06:04:58", "text": "因为如果我扮演瓦莱林的话，那就不会了。"}]